    "title": "Man arrested on DUI, weapon charges in Clifton Park - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Daniel Duric ,\n1 days ago CLIFTON PARK, NY — The Sheriff’s Office conducted a vehicle stop Sunday at 1:23 a.m. on Interstate 87 in the town of Clifton Park for moving violations. A subsequent investigation led to the stop resulted in the arrest of the below person for criminal possession of a weapon in the 2nd degree (class C felony), criminal possession of a weapon in the 3rd degree (class A misdemeanor), DWI, operating a motor vehicle with blood alcohol content of 0.08% or greater (unclassified misdemeanors), moving from lane unsafely and unlicensed operation of a motor vehicle (violations). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
